# agent-foundry project

Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) first for architecture, commands, and boundaries.

## Repo map

- `agent_foundry/` — CLI, installers, validation
- `plugins/` + `registry/plugins.yaml` — distributable plugins
- `tests/` — `unittest` suite

## Before opening a PR

```bash
pip install -e .
agent-foundry validate-plugins
python -m unittest discover -s tests -p "test_*.py"
vulture agent_foundry tests --min-confidence 100
```

Keep diffs focused. Use Conventional Commits. Fill `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md`.

Human workflow: [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md).
